		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=355,
	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010010e"},
		line=355,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"An airy and ethereal aroma gently wafts betwixt the grove of vermilion-lacquered pillars.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The long shadows cast by the outside light whisper of accumulated eons of yore.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Having come face-to-face with this majestic phoenix perched in her parapet, the summoned priestess cowers even further into herself.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Empress Hisui sits on her throne.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Her regal figure, lovely as a daffodil, leaves a deep impression on the priestess, even though they are of a similar age.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"─This personage truly bears the blood of Oomikami, the deity to whom she dedicates her every prayer.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Shiinoha Kotone, I hereby anoint you as this Empire's 192nd Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The station of Exalt-Priestess is of paramount national importance, for she holds dominion over the very essence of magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You shall surely be met with many adversities to come, but I pray that you may remain in good health and render most faithful service.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Chancellor Okonogi Tokihiko steps forward from the long line of ministers.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"He faces towards Kotone and wordlessly holds out a letter of appointment.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I humbly accept this station.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Kotone bows deeply.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestess is the head of the priesthood, chiefest among all five thousand of its priests and priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"In the first place, the priesthood are practitioners of the Tento faith, which exalts Oomikami and His progenitor gods as objects of worship.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"They learn magicks through rigorous training, and they have worked closely with warriors in service of the\nEmpire's defense since ancient times.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Moreover, to the general public, they hold powers over life and death itself.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Be it childbirth, coming-of-age, malady, or quietus─",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"On all occasions of great import, the common people flock to the temple in search of prayers.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(But... why me?)”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"At this very moment, the young girl being ordained to this high station is internally tilting her head in puzzlement.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"For generations, only those who excel above all in matters of scholastics, arcanery, and virtue have been granted the station of Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Her excellent skills as a magicker aside, Kotone is well aware that she is somewhat lacking in strength of character.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Moreover, the previous Exalt-Priestess is still missing in action from the war, and even now, it is unclear whether she is among the living.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"She wonders if it is truly permissible to ordain a successor in this situation.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You are still quite young.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am but a mere inexperienced shadow of my predecessor, but I shall spare absolutely no effort in living up to my station.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Work hard in your endeavors.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You have done well today, Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Kotone is ordered to withdraw, but she doesn't move a muscle.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Finally, having made up her mind, she falls prostrate.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“With all due respect, there is a matter on which I beg to inquire.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Oh? Let's hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You have my deepest gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Kotone lowers herself even further.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Might the whereabouts of my predecessor still remain unknown?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“We know nothing. Truly heart-breaking.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Okonogi answers without a change in his expression.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-Then why might it have been that Barrier ceased functioning at the war's outbreak? My predecessor was among those stationed to its defense.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“That is unknown.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Might I be granted permission to investigate the cause?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Unlikely. You would need authorization from the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Many priestesses disappeared without warning after the war. Might it be possible to investigate their whereabouts?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Hmm. I'll consider it.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"It took Kotone a great deal of courage to ask these questions, but to Okonogi, they hardly seemed worth his concern.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Her courage withers each time she hears another of his terse, disinterested responses.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“O-One last─”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Okonogi strikes the floor with tip of his boot.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The job of the Exalt-Priestess is to pray for the peace of the people.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Do not allow these trivialities to lead you astray.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Just cloister yourself in the temple and avoid sticking your nose where it doesn't belong─",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Kotone understands Okonogi's thinly-veiled imperative.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Okonogi is insinuating that there is no need to oversee magicks or the Barrier, as all previous Exalt-Priestesses have done.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(Is that why they chose a novice like me?)”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Kotone understands, but deep within her, the spirit of defiance rears its head.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As one entrusted with the peace of the deceased, I would make a request.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“On the upcoming anniversary, in the name of the Exalt-Priestess, might I be granted permission to conduct a memorial service for victims of the war?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“No need.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you mean to say we ought not mourn the dead?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Enough.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Kotone hangs her head.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Her body quivers with humiliation.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Begone.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Kotone does not move.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Did I not make myself clear?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"She still does not move.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"The audience chamber is set abuzz by the girl's unexpected show of courage.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Y-Your Eminence?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“W-With all due respect, Your Majesty...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um... I would personally be most obliged to withdraw, but I am afraid the nerves have sapped all strength from my legs.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I fear I may ≪knee-d≫ some assistance to extricate myself from this predicament.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"The taciturn atmosphere of the Imperial Palace pierces into Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ohh! Umm, you see, in the Republic's language, ≪knee≫ is the term used to refer to the patellofemoral joint, and so...”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hehee, hehehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(That actually landed?! Praise be to Oomikami!)”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, perhaps you ought to retire.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hehee... Fare thee well, Your Eminence. Hehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Empress Hisui retreats from the audience chamber, barely managing to suppress her laughter.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(My life flashed before my very eyes!)”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"The strings of her tension cut, Kotone limply collapses into a heap on the floor.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
